### Create a customer
POST http://localhost:8081/api/v1/customers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Fatima Al Marri",
  "email": "fatima.almarri@example.com",
  "mobile": "+971501234567",
  "dateOfBirth": "1990-05-14",
  "nationality": "ARE"
}

### Get a customer by id (replace {{customerId}} with an id returned above)
GET http://localhost:8081/api/v1/customers/{{customerId}}

### Search customers by name or email, paged
GET http://localhost:8081/api/v1/customers?search=fatima&page=0&size=10

### Validation failure example (missing required fields)
POST http://localhost:8081/api/v1/customers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "",
  "email": "not-an-email"
}

### Not found example
GET http://localhost:8081/api/v1/customers/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
